    "finding": "BoxScoreTraditionalV3 emits a non-empty position only for the five starters of each team, always in the sequence F,F,C,G,G. The field denotes a starting-lineup slot, not a player attribute, so a distribution over it is forced to 2F:2G:1C for any cohort and cannot establish positional diversity. A blank is 'did not start this game', which is knowable, not 'position unknown'.",
